# AI assistant artifacts
context-snapshot.json

# Name collision, not intent. superpowers' track-edits hook auto-appends any of
# project-map.md / session-log.md / state.md / known-issues.md here the moment one is
# edited. Ours are real tracked files, and .gitignore does not apply to tracked files,
# so these two lines change nothing — they exist only to stop the hook re-adding them
# and dirtying the diff every session. If either is ever untracked, use `git add -f`.
state.md
session-log.md
